  "title": "Two Hemispheres, One Week of Water: Bangkok Declares All Fifty Districts Emergency Zones as a Nor'easter Puts New York and New Jersey Under States of Emergency",
  "short": "Two Hemispheres, One Week of Water: Bangkok Declares All Fifty Districts Emergency Zones as a Nor'easter Puts New…",
